#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: aa3e24ea9d86442bb0684a6933a845e3
msgid ""
"README integers: `1` HOME, `2` HOLD, `3` OCS2. Operators and "
"`ros2_robot_interface` send them on **`/fsm_command`**. Starts in HOLD; "
"OCS2 returns only to HOLD. Shared `FSMCommandPublisher` also defines `4` "
"MOVEJ"
msgstr ""
"README 整数：`1` HOME、`2` HOLD、`3` OCS2。操作员与 `ros2_robot_interface` 把它们发到 "
"**`/fsm_command`**。启动在 HOLD；OCS2 只能回到 HOLD。共享的 `FSMCommandPublisher` 还定义了"
" `4` MOVEJ"

