"(VR / high-rate teleop). Stamped `/left_target/stamped` runs TF into the "
"controller frame and interpolates a **MoveL** sequence (vision pick / "
"RViz absolute). Far unstamped jumps can jerk."
msgstr ""
"不带 stamp 的 `/left_target` 用**一个**位姿替换当前末端目标（VR / 高频率遥操作）。带 stamp 的 "
"`/left_target/stamped` 会经 TF 变换到控制器坐标系并插值成 **MoveL** 序列（视觉抓取 / RViz 绝对）。未"
" stamp 的远距离跳变可能产生冲击。"

