msgid ""
"`/body_target*`, `/head_target*`, `/mode_command`, and `WbcCurrentState` "
"(`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`) need **`ocs2_wbc_controller`** and"
" that robot’s 全身 launch/config (`full_body.launch.py` when the controller"
" type is `ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController`). Default mock demos "
"(`demo.launch.py`) and 分体 (`split_body.launch.py`) do **not** imply these"
" features are present."
msgstr "`/body_target*`、`/head_target*`、`/mode_command` 以及 `WbcCurrentState`（`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`）需要 **`ocs2_wbc_controller`** 以及该机型的全身启动/配置（控制器类型为 `ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController` 时用 `full_body.launch.py`）。默认 mock 演示（`demo.launch.py`）和分体（`split_body.launch.py`）**并不表示**这些能力可用。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:95
#: f71743900d0b492a9bad12b4061b6cf1
msgid ""
"The controller is a **private** submodule; extra FSM states stay in that "
"README after access. Which constraints are live is machine-dependent "
"(`WbcCapability` in the [msgs README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md):"
" mobile base, body relative, head 6D, midpoint gaze, …). Public Taku mock"
" (`robot:=taku` on `demo.launch.py`) is arm-controller, not WBC; even on "
"全身, head 6D tracking is only there when the controller reports "
"`head_tracking_ee_enabled`."
msgstr "该控制器是**私有**子模块；额外 FSM 状态开通后见该仓库 README。哪些约束真正生效取决于机型（[msgs README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md) 中的 `WbcCapability`：移动底盘、身体相对、头部 6D、中点注视等）。公开的 Taku mock（`demo.launch.py` 上 `robot:=taku`）走的是臂控制器，不是 WBC；即便在全身上，也只有控制器报出 `head_tracking_ee_enabled` 时才有头部 6D 跟踪。"

