#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:121
#: 0843a053b4df4f378ca29899bd006d23
msgid "MOVEJ + stamped → IK MoveL"
msgstr "MOVEJ + stamped → IK MoveL"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:123
#: f536cebc92e145eda5215e470a4638d6
msgid ""
"`PoseBasedReferenceManager` is the sole holder of `left` / `right` / "
"`dual_target/stamped` and the TF buffer. While FSM is **OCS2**, stamped "
"writes the Cartesian reference buffer. While FSM is **not** OCS2, stamped"
" is forwarded to `StateMoveJ.startLinearTrajectory` (lina **MoveL** + "
"per-point IK), same semantics as `execute_linear`. Empty vel/acc/jerk "
"fall back to controller `cartesian_defaults` (README defaults: "
"`max_linear_velocity=0.25`, `ik_type=AUTO`, `time_mode=false`). Without "
"[lina_planning](../4-reference/controllers/5-lina_planning.md) the MOVEJ "
"side is a no-op."
msgstr ""
"`PoseBasedReferenceManager` 是 `left` / `right` / `dual_target/stamped` 与 "
"TF buffer 的唯一持有者。FSM 为 **OCS2** 时，stamped 写入笛卡尔参考缓冲；**非 OCS2** 时转给 "
"`StateMoveJ.startLinearTrajectory`（lina **MoveL** + 逐点 IK），语义同 "
"`execute_linear`。vel/acc/jerk 留空则回退控制器 `cartesian_defaults`（README "
"默认：`max_linear_velocity=0.25`，`ik_type=AUTO`，`time_mode=false`）。没有 "
"[lina_planning](../4-reference/controllers/5-lina_planning.md) 时，MOVEJ "
"侧为空操作。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:125
#: 02c7e039da8649b29cb6056908eec9c0
msgid ""
"This IK MoveL path is on **`ocs2_arm_controller`**. `ocs2_wbc_controller`"
" MOVEJ is **joint-only** (no IK MoveL). `full_body.launch.py` sets "
"`enable_movej_cartesian_markers:=false` on WBC, so MOVEJ arm markers stay"
" hidden. Python `send_target_stamped` publishes the same stamped topic; "
"keep FSM at MOVEJ (turn off pose auto-switch to OCS2) for the IK path. "
"The RViz Joint panel MOVEJ path still publishes joint arrays only."
msgstr ""
"这条 IK MoveL 路径在 **`ocs2_arm_controller`**。`ocs2_wbc_controller` 的 MOVEJ "
"**只有关节**（无 IK MoveL）。`full_body.launch.py` 在 WBC 下设 "
"`enable_movej_cartesian_markers:=false`，MOVEJ 手臂 marker 保持隐藏。Python "
"`send_target_stamped` 发同一条 stamped 话题；要走 IK 路径须保持 FSM=MOVEJ（关闭位姿类自动切 "
"OCS2）。RViz Joint 面板的 MOVEJ 仍只发关节数组。"

