"(goal, progress feedback, result), and sometimes a **service** (one-shot "
"RPC). Definitions: [`arms_ros2_control_msgs` README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)."
" Which names a controller actually advertises is on that controller; the "
"tables below list the types in that README."
msgstr "同一运动可以是**话题**（发出即走）、**Action**（目标、进度反馈、结果），有时还有**服务**（一次请求/响应）。定义见 [`arms_ros2_control_msgs` README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)。控制器实际 advertise 哪些名字以该控制器为准；下表列出该 README 中的类型。"

